{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>背了三萬個單詞，翻開第一頁英文小說仍然停住？Zi Yue English 不計算你學過多少字，而是量度你此刻能讀懂一本真實英文書的幾成，並直接翻到你應付得來的那一頁。它為中文讀者而設，報告、註釋與故事均以中文書寫，只有書本本身及所教單詞是英文；介面為簡體中文，不讀中文者並不適合。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-116.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>先量度可讀程度再開卷</h2>\n<p>首次只需回答 50 個單詞，約 3 分鐘即有報告：對照 15 部英文小說的真實詞彙，給出可讀比例、信心區間及通往 95% 與 98% 的最省力單詞。故事以中文行文，只把報告指定的單詞換成英文，讓你靠上下文猜測；也可開啟英文原著，段落下附中文註釋。程式離線運作，不收集資料，亦無內購。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-378-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-379-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-380-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-381-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-382-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-383-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Zi Yue English</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/zi-yue-english/id6449222861?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:22:07.385635+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:57:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T00:58:44.420280+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:18:38.125617+00:00","content_hash":"cce552811dcbe3a2bdaee03f5e570a4ba2bce3789cbf75fcee810e7b73ba08cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:22:07.385635+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}